HB0254 Microphones in the house of representatives.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Larson, JT and Harshman and
Senator(s) Schuler
AN ACT relating to legislative process; requiring the installation of
microphones at the desks of members in the house of representatives; providing
an appropriation; and providing for an effective date.
